{
  "$comment": "Reviewed payloads of the finished installers (open-source-release-2026-09-29 P-017, WI-10003906). Read by scripts/check-licenses.mjs --installer-tree, which audit-release-bundle.py --scan-artifact --licenses runs on every platform's finished installer. Each entry covers the files matching its path globs (relative to the unpacked installer; `**` spans directories, members of a nested archive are addressed `<archive>!/<member>`). A nested archive matched by an entry is covered whole and not expanded. Add an entry only after reading the component's real license text. kind: first-party | program | library | model | os-image | bundle. `aggregate: true` marks a separate program shipped beside the app under a copyleft license (allowed; its source must be offered). Model weights need kind \"model\": a package's code license never covers them.",
