      "reason": "Built from this repository. papercusp-desktop.exe is the first-party Rust binary declared in papercusp-desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml under Elastic-2.0; the terms are in scripts/public-release/LICENSE. Their third-party dependencies are gated by the npm and Cargo lockfile legs of the same check."
